  "downloads": 2705,
  "description": "<h3>WTT-Content Backport compatibility and variants addon for Definitive Weapon Variants</h3>\n<h2>Requires</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2010/definitive-weapon-variants\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Definitive Weapon Variants</a> version 4.1.0 or higher</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2512/wtt-content-backport\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT-Content Backport</a> version 1.0.4 or higher</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<p>This add-on includes configuration files for Backport weapons to being easily used in Definitive Weapon Variants mod, and is adding:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>29 new variants to existing types</li>\n<li>1 new variant type with 8 new variant weapons<br />\nBaseline Variant type - Dragunov<br />\nWeapon variant chambered in 9.3x64mm caliber with matching TKPD magazines</li>\n<li>3 new unique variants with unique presets<br />\nMXLR &gt;Endless Quick-scope&lt;<br />\nAK-308 &gt;Meta HMG&lt;<br />\nNL545 GP &gt;Larger Laser Rifle&lt;</li>\n<li>1 variant to existing unique variant with their own preset<br />\nAS VAL MOD.4 &gt;Unbreakable P&amp;C&lt;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Install</h2>\n<p>Extract to the main folder of the game</p>\n<h2>Uninstall</h2>\n<p>Remove files from mod folder (SPT 4.0/SPT/user/mods/DefinitiveWeaponVariants):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>db/01_Variants/20_BackportVariants.json</li>\n<li>db/01_Variants/21_BackportUniqueVariants.json</li>\n<li>db/02_Items/20_BackportItems.json</li>\n<li>db/02_Items/21_BackportUniqueItems.json</li>\n</ul>\n",
